#: ../../site/guides/factor-research.md:1
msgid "Factor research"
msgstr "因子研究"

#: ../../site/guides/factor-research.md:3
msgid ""
"The native factor workflow separates preparation, evaluation and reporting:"
msgstr "原生因子工作流将准备、评估和报告三个阶段分离："

#: ../../site/guides/factor-research.md:5
msgid ""
"`prepare_factor_data` aligns a factor panel with forward returns and assigns "
"quantiles on the documented cross-section."
msgstr ""
"`prepare_factor_data` 将因子面板与前瞻收益率对齐，并在文档说明的横截面上分配"
"分位数。"

#: ../../site/guides/factor-research.md:7
msgid ""
"`analyze_factor` builds an owning model for tears, IC, turnover and group "
"views."
msgstr ""
"`analyze_factor` 构建一个拥有所有权的模型，用于业绩速览（tears）、IC、换手率"
"和分组视图。"

#: ../../site/guides/factor-research.md:9
msgid ""
"`evaluate_factor_research` evaluates a factor panel against a price grid "
"with explicit targets, periods, labels and preprocessing."
msgstr ""
"`evaluate_factor_research` 依据价格网格评估因子面板，并显式指定目标、周期、标"
"签和预处理。"

#: ../../site/guides/factor-research.md:11
msgid ""
"Report/chart builders consume the frozen result rather than recomputing "
"backward dependencies in renderers."
msgstr "报告/图表构建器使用已冻结的结果，而不是在渲染器中重新计算反向依赖。"

#: ../../site/guides/factor-research.md:14
msgid ""
"Factor alignment, missing labels, quantile ties and label horizons are "
"contractual inputs. A high IC or a benchmark speedup is not evidence that a "
"factor is profitable. See the repository's dated benchmark records before "
"quoting performance numbers."
msgstr ""
"因子对齐、缺失标签、分位数并列和标签预测期都是契约输入。高 IC 或基准加速比并"
"不能证明因子能够盈利。在引用性能数据之前，请查阅仓库中带日期的基准记录。"
